    "long_instructions": "### **Generate with AI**\r\n\r\n#### **Do This:**\r\n\r\n1. **Plan:** In `prompt.md`, write a prompt that asks AI to refactor the event handler into an arrow function.\r\n\r\n2. **Build:** Highlight the event handler and select **Add to AI Tutor Chat**. Use your prompt to generate the updated code.\r\n\r\n3. **Test:** Click the **Increase Progress** button and check that it still works as expected.\r\n\r\n4. **Check Code:** Look for where the code:\r\n\r\n   * defines a **named function**\r\n   * uses **arrow function syntax**\r\n   * uses the function name as the event handler in `addEventListener`\r\n",
